WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
For developers. The Shopping Agent on Your Side.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.450
Step 1, purpose and scope. Start with the job: restock household basics. Never run out, never overspend. Success is on time and inside the limit. Only stores the person allows.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.950
Step 2, instructions and guardrails. A careful household buyer. Compare, then ask before buying. Never order outside the limits. The person’s limits always win.

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.450
Step 3, model and tools. Choose the model for reasoning, cost and speed. Find offers, read only. Request a quote, price held briefly. Hand off to the store’s checkout; the store stays the seller. Every tool is declared up front.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.950
Step 4, memory and orchestration. Past orders the person shares. A trigger when pods run low. It asks a store’s agent for a quote. If the price moved, it asks again. A message between agents is a request, not a permission.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.450
Step 5, interface. A chat people already know. Restock pods and coffee under $60 a month. Pods $22 and coffee $34, $56, inside your limit. Approve? It asks. They approve.

7
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.450
Step 6, test in the sandbox. Price changed mid-task: asked again. Pack size swapped: caught. Hidden instruction in a listing: ignored. Spend limit reached: refused. 45 of 45 runs passed. No money moved.

8
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:40.950
Step 7, deploy. Our app: each shopper switches it on. Mini-Stores: the store offers it. Partner Mini-Programs: the partner approves first. Other agents: checked on every call. Nothing runs until someone says yes.

9
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:45.950
Step 8, earn, proposed. A fee per successful task, shown first. No fee when a task is not completed. Paid ranking is never on offer. A proposal: nothing is live yet.

10
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.950
It never spends on its own. Deploying never lets an agent spend. The person’s limits decide every order. The payment provider authorises payment. The store stays the seller.

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:53.450
Safe, Fast, Fun!

12
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:57.450
The Shopping Agent on Your Side. Register technical interest.
